WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.259
First, open Copilot CLI.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.418
Type /review to run the built-in code review agent.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.875
Copilot thinks about your request.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.959
It decides to launch a code review agent.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.989
The agent starts in the background on your changes.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.543
Copilot waits for the agent to finish.

00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:29.282
Like an expert review before you push.
